  "body": "## What changed (first slice of #163)\n\nThe launching terminal now says what the app is doing.\n\n- New workspace deps `tracing` and `tracing-subscriber` (fmt + env-filter, MIT; notice in `assets/ui/LICENSES.md`).\n- `camcraft_app::logging::init()` installs one stderr subscriber, called first thing by both binaries (`camcraft`, `camcraft-cli`). Filter from `CAMCRAFT_LOG`, else `RUST_LOG`, else `info` with `wgpu_core`/`wgpu_hal`/`naga`/`winit` at `warn`; `tracing-log` bridges the GPU stack's `log` records. A second `init()` is a no-op.\n- Events at the seams the issue names:\n  - **project save / open** (`project/wire.rs`): `project saved path=… bytes=… entities=…` / `project opened …`, or `project not saved|opened: <why>` at warn;\n  - **post** (`posting::post_script`, now a thin wrapper over `post_script_body`): `NC program written path=… bytes=… ops=… lines=… ms=…`, or `NC program not written: <why>` at warn - including a blocked post's reasons;\n  - **generation** (`operation::run_job`, so single, command and batch generations alike - `GenJob` now carries the op name): a `generate{op=…}` span, `generated kind=… moves=… warnings=… ms=…`, or `generation refused: <why>` at warn;\n  - **commands** (`History`): `execute command=<Type>` and `undo` at debug.\n- Example: `CAMCRAFT_LOG=debug camcraft-cli …`.\n- Decision recorded in `RECOMMENDED.md` (#163).\n\n## Not in this slice (why `Refs`, not `Fixes`)\n\nConverting the ~185 `println!`/`eprintln!` calls, and per-limit \"which budget fired, what took over\" events inside the generators (today their refusal text rides the warn line). Those stay open on #163.\n\n## Gate (own worktree build; batch tier for a Cargo change)\n\n- `cargo test -p camcraft-app --tests`: 1008 passed; only `drilling_axial::a_drill_where_the_model_has_no_hole_is_convicted` fails (known on main).\n- `cargo test -p camcraft-ui`: green except `egui_shell_snapshot_light` / `tool_editor_snapshot` - 1 and 4 px software-GL diffs, identical counts on main.\n- motion + post + sim: green except `swarf_pose_continuity` x2 (known on main); `overhang_laws` 11/11 after rebasing on e607ca1.\n- `cargo clippy` on geometry, cl, tools, post, sim, motion, app, ui `--all-targets -- -D warnings`: clean.\n- Both binaries build; `CAMCRAFT_LOG=debug camcraft-cli --help` prints usage normally.\n\n## Pinning tests\n\n- `logging::save_generate_and_post_each_name_what_they_did` (captured log: save path, `op=Face1`, moves, NC path + bytes, `command=\"SetStock\"`)\n- `logging::a_failed_open_and_a_refused_post_say_why`\n- `logging::the_default_filter_is_used_when_the_environment_names_none`\n\nChangelog: The launching terminal logs project save/open, NC writes, generations and commands (CAMCRAFT_LOG / RUST_LOG filter)\n\nOutside contributor PR (fork) - feat, merges at the next cut.\n\nRefs #163\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
